/* Review before backup */
"Review before backup" = "备份前检查";
"Click a picture to watch the video or see the photo full size. Pick what to delete, then either delete first and back up the rest, or back up first and delete afterwards. Deleted items go to Recently Deleted in Photos, where they can be recovered for 30 days; iCloud Photos then removes them from the phone too." = "点按图片可以播放视频或查看大图。选好要删除的项目后，可以先删除再备份其余内容，也可以先备份再删除。删除的项目会进入“照片”的“最近删除”，30 天内可以恢复；iCloud 照片随后也会把它们从手机上删除。";
