/* Review before a direct import into Photos */
"Review before importing into Photos" = "导入“照片”前检查";
"Click a picture to watch the video or see the photo full size. Pick what you don't want, then delete it and import the rest. Selected items that are already in Photos go to Recently Deleted, where they can be recovered for 30 days, and iCloud Photos removes them from the phone too. Selected items are not imported either way." = "点按图片可以播放视频或查看大图。选出不想要的项目，删除后再导入其余内容。所选项目如果已在“照片”里，会进入“最近删除”，30 天内可以恢复，iCloud 照片也会把它们从手机上删除。无论是否在“照片”里，所选项目都不会导入。";
"Import Without Deleting" = "只导入，不删除";
"Delete Selected, Then Import…" = "删除所选项目，再导入…";
"Move the selected items to Recently Deleted in Photos, then import the rest of the phone" = "先把所选项目移到“照片”的“最近删除”，再导入手机上的其余内容";
"Delete the selected items, then import?" = "删除所选项目后再导入？";
